7. Testing Checklist

7.1 Resume Upload (Step 8)
1. Upload zone renders with drag-and-drop + file picker
2. PDF upload works — file stored, text extracted, keywords extracted
3. DOCX upload works — same flow
4. Auto-filter created with extracted keywords as What pills
5. Resume set as active (activeResumeId written)
6. Skip link advances to Step 9 without creating resume or filter
7. 5MB limit enforced — oversized file shows error
8. PostHog events fire: wizard_resume_uploaded or wizard_resume_skipped

7.2 Application Mode (Step 9)
9. 6 mode cards render with correct labels and icons
10. Manual is default selected
11. Selecting a mode writes to apply settings
12. Score-gated modes show inline threshold slider
13. Threshold value persists to apply settings
14. PostHog wizard_mode_selected fires

7.3 Completion
15. Finish button triggers prompt assembly from steps 1-7
16. Resume from step 8 is NOT included in prompt text
17. Mode from step 9 is NOT included in prompt text
18. checkAndSetSetupComplete() runs — setup_complete = true when
    resume uploaded + mode selected
19. User lands on feed with populated filters
20. wizard_completed_full PostHog event fires with all properties

7.4 Regression
21. Skipping both step 8 and step 9 still completes wizard
    (steps are not required)
22. Existing 7-step flow unchanged — steps 1-7 behave identically
23. Progress bar shows 9 segments
24. Back navigation works through all 9 steps

8. Deployment

Standard pipeline: dev → staging → main → git tag → Vercel deploy.
All HTML cache busters updated (?v= params).
Version bump per VERSION_METHODOLOGY.docx.
Roadmap P12 card updated on deploy.

9. Session Estimate

Single session. Both steps reuse existing infrastructure:
  - Resume upload: addResume() + extractResumeKeywords() +
    commitSaveFilter() all exist
  - Mode selection: same card pattern as Steps 1/5, writes to
    existing apply settings

No new EFs. No new migrations. No new tables.
